{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2023-05-23 09:15:00', 'title': 'CBOE REPORTS RECORD Q1 2023 EARNINGS WITH A 60% INCREASE IN DILUTED EPS', 'text': 'CHICAGO, IL / ACCESSWIRE / MAY 23, 2023 / CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS (BATS:CBOE) RECENTLY ANNOUNCED ITS EARNINGS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023, SHOWCASING RECORD-BREAKING RESULTS. THE COMPANY REPORTED A 60% INCREASE IN DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE (EPS), REACHING $1.63, WHILE ACHIEVING RECORD ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS OF $1.90, REPRESENTING A 10% INCREASE.'}